Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.40,0:00:10.90,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在心灵的街道中{\fad(250,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.50,0:00:17.34,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闪耀着希望之光{\fad(0,250)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.94,0:00:23.54,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用虚幻的羽翼挥动着梦想
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.25,0:00:30.48,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你与我寻找的目标
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.12,0:00:46.93,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真理总是隐藏在眼中 蓝蓝的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.77,0:00:53.21,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要往何处去
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.91,0:00:59.89,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,俩人未来与现今的流浪{\fad(50,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.29,0:01:05.95,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们继续踏上旅程{\fad(0,50)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.49,0:01:12.57,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,永远的目标地 无止尽的梦
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.77,0:01:23.87,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望能不放手不断追寻 直到永远{\fad(0,1000)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.14,0:01:40.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无法动弹了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.81,0:01:41.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.68,0:01:43.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不论用跑的用冲的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.05,0:01:45.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都不可能摆脱我的风的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.88,0:01:47.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,风刃
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.82,0:01:55.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.43,0:02:03.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要逃的话只有趁
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.77,0:02:06.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落的结界变松散的现在
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.14,0:02:09.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是只怕奈落…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.95,0:02:16.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.62,0:02:20.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,若是那男人的话…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.79,0:02:26.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该拥有能切断 我与奈落之间障碍的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.46,0:02:29.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.80,0:02:32.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗨
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.70,0:02:34.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还“嗨”咧 你不是？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.30,0:02:38.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你叫作风使神乐吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.67,0:02:41.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真高兴 你还记得我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.04,0:02:45.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,手先放开剑
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.31,0:02:47.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不是来找你打架的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.61,0:02:51.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸 要不要和我交易
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.35,0:02:53.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,交易？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.55,0:02:56.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个是什么 你应该知道吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.49,0:03:00.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些四魂碎片 我可以给你
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.59,0:03:05.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,条件是…把奈落杀了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.23,0:03:06.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.10,0:03:10.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我从那家伙的身边解脱
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.17,0:03:17.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第67话 狂乱飞舞的背叛之风
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.99,0:03:22.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以你的力量绝对能办到
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.10,0:03:24.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要杀了奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.46,0:03:26.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就能得到他收集到的碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.87,0:03:33.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要使用它 不就能随心所欲吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.11,0:03:36.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,意思是你背叛了奈落吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.11,0:03:40.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我本来就不是心甘情愿服从那家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.01,0:03:42.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么样？杀生丸
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.88,0:03:45.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不觉得跟我联手不会吃亏吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.35,0:03:48.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真不巧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.99,0:03:51.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我对什么四魂之玉没有兴趣
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.26,0:03:53.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想要自由的话
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.03,0:03:55.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自己利用那碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.89,0:03:58.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀死奈落不就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.26,0:04:00.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怕奈落吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.53,0:04:05.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的意思是 我没有义务协助你
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.01,0:04:10.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你没有独自一人下手的觉悟
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.21,0:04:12.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么最好不要想背叛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.74,0:04:14.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这个胆小鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.75,0:04:16.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样还算是男子汉吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.48,0:04:19.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看错人了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.62,0:04:26.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,浑蛋家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.69,0:04:31.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个女人…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.30,0:04:35.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是真的想找杀生丸少爷做后盾吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.07,0:04:38.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该说她不知天高地厚
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.00,0:04:39.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是没有自知之明
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.21,0:04:42.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明明只是个奈落的分身罢了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.01,0:04:45.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸少爷好强呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.78,0:04:48.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,根本不需要什么四魂之力
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.58,0:04:50.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,风使神乐…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.95,0:04:54.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底能不能 自己用碎片的力量打倒奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.95,0:04:57.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然不管结果怎样
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.22,0:04:58.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都与我无关
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.46,0:05:06.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸少爷 要出发了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.90,0:05:11.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,糟了 忘了东西
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.04,0:05:11.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来 走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.04,0:05:16.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸少爷
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.11,0:05:19.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然小玲现在不是一个人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.68,0:05:22.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个人是不是一个人太孤单了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.19,0:05:30.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸少爷
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.32,0:05:33.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今晚晚餐您想吃什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.13,0:05:43.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好痛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.27,0:05:44.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是不是绑得太紧了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.00,0:05:47.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不会 谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.01,0:05:49.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有你亲手包扎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.34,0:05:50.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也就不觉得痛了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.01,0:05:52.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个死了无所谓的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.78,0:05:53.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不用管他 戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.65,0:05:55.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.65,0:05:56.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不痛的话
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.65,0:05:58.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就快点滚回巢穴去
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.58,0:06:00.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这只瘦皮狼
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.09,0:06:05.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你才是一副 不堪一击的人类模样
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.46,0:06:09.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,居然还夸口想要跟我打
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.73,0:06:11.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我又不是喜欢变成这样子
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.80,0:06:12.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要打吗 臭家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.10,0:06:15.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来啊 求之不得
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.87,0:06:17.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.04,0:06:20.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们不想去取回四魂碎片吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.61,0:06:28.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么你也跟着一起走啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.18,0:06:30.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,少罗唆 那是我的碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.82,0:06:32.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么能够给你
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.75,0:06:35.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么 神乐并没有回到城里吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.25,0:06:38.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对 不只是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.12,0:06:40.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四魂碎片的气息
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.89,0:06:44.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,似乎离奈落城的结界愈来愈远了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.50,0:06:47.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.33,0:06:49.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,神乐是奈落的分身
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.94,0:06:52.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是依照奈落的指示行动吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.41,0:06:56.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,神乐拿着碎片逃走了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.21,0:06:57.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不是不可能的事
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.01,0:07:00.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道你不觉得奇怪吗 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.01,0:07:01.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,结界的事情也是
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.92,0:07:05.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么你和钢牙
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.65,0:07:07.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能闻得到城的味道
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.79,0:07:08.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为结界变弱了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.09,0:07:10.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那不就是代表现在
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.42,0:07:13.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落的妖力衰退了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.09,0:07:17.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妖力衰退了…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.96,0:07:18.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这仿佛就像是
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.10,0:07:22.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错 奈落也是半妖
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.17,0:07:24.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,由人类鬼蜘蛛做维系
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.67,0:07:27.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,汇集了众多妖怪而成的妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.81,0:07:28.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.04,0:07:30.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落是半妖吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.94,0:07:33.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像犬夜叉在朔日会丧失妖力
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.98,0:07:38.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说不定奈落 也有妖力衰退的日子
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.62,0:07:42.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,意思是奈落也有弱点吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.49,0:08:19.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,神乐
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.49,0:08:22.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你逃也没用的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.00,0:08:29.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个只动嘴的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.53,0:08:30.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就这样随便乱说
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.74,0:08:32.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.01,0:08:35.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你没有独自一人下手的觉悟
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.37,0:08:38.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么最好不要想背叛
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.61,0:08:41.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,居然要我自己使用
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.88,0:08:45.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后杀了奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.62,0:08:53.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我闻到了…是神乐
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.13,0:08:56.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你们的照顾
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.39,0:08:57.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我先走了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.50,0:08:58.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钢牙
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.63,0:08:59.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那浑蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.90,0:09:02.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钢牙 伤势不要紧了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.77,0:09:04.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我已经痊愈了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.27,0:09:05.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟那个废物不同
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.90,0:09:07.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可是真正的妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.01,0:09:08.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.91,0:09:09.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再见了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.14,0:09:11.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁是废物啊 浑蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.91,0:09:12.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.14,0:09:14.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,失去四魂碎片的钢牙
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.15,0:09:16.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想报仇只是自投罗网
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.92,0:09:17.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.05,0:09:19.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,云母 把犬夜叉放下来
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.16,0:09:25.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.52,0:09:27.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你暂时安份的待在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.66,0:09:30.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶 别开玩笑了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.43,0:09:31.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也要去
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.43,0:09:34.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要冲动 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.57,0:09:41.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,毒虫飞过去了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.07,0:09:44.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看样子奈落有所行动了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.81,0:09:47.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是犬夜叉的姿态被他看到就惨了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.18,0:09:53.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,神乐
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.59,0:10:00.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,神乐 你这家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.19,0:10:02.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了 钢牙
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.19,0:10:03.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有什么事吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.83,0:10:04.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,少罗唆
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.10,0:10:07.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你从我这抢走的四魂碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.10,0:10:08.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点还给我
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.34,0:10:13.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是你找犬夜叉他们帮忙的原因吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.34,0:10:17.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没了这个 你就怕到不敢一个人应战吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.61,0:10:20.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,神乐由我来对付
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.58,0:10:22.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要多管闲事
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.35,0:10:23.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.35,0:10:26.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别忘了我还有狼爪跟獠牙
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.85,0:10:28.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就试试看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.72,0:10:30.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,风刃之舞
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.14,0:10:44.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.14,0:10:47.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,光闪躲就很吃力 无法靠近她
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.01,0:10:50.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点去死吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.88,0:11:02.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可没有闲功夫跟你耗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.93,0:11:08.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钢牙
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.79,0:11:10.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要过来
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.27,0:11:15.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你很烦耶
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.90,0:11:18.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想要自由的话
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.27,0:11:19.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自己利用那碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.90,0:11:21.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀死奈落不就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.18,0:11:26.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.32,0:11:33.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.42,0:11:36.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就用看看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.92,0:11:38.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.32,0:11:40.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这样根本不能跟她打嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.30,0:11:46.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落的妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.44,0:11:55.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.57,0:11:59.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每次都只会以量取胜
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.82,0:12:07.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落还没有发现吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.85,0:12:10.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想要背叛他的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.72,0:12:12.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是说…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.46,0:12:15.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他想将我收拾掉
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.23,0:12:18.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在发什么呆
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.00,0:12:24.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四魂碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.87,0:12:26.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我拿走了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.97,0:12:28.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,龙蛇之舞
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.62,0:12:40.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钢牙这家伙根本就不行嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.75,0:12:42.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是放着不管他会被杀的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.62,0:12:47.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒 这次不要再阻止我了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.49,0:12:49.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想去帮助钢牙吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.23,0:12:50.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别开玩笑了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.50,0:12:52.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我闻到四魂碎片的味道了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.13,0:12:55.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是钢牙被杀
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.77,0:12:56.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,事情就这样结束的话
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.87,0:12:59.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又会让神乐跑掉
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.27,0:13:01.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我怎么能袖手旁观呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.27,0:13:04.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等 不行啊 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.74,0:13:06.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,停下来啊 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.38,0:13:11.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.52,0:13:18.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天亮了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.29,0:13:20.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉能变回半妖了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.16,0:13:25.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是 万一在那之前他的样子被看到的话
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.66,0:13:28.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇 弥勒 珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.17,0:13:29.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,连只是普通的人类的你们
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.93,0:13:31.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都一直战斗到现在
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.90,0:13:32.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是因为
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.04,0:13:35.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们相信自己的力量不是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.17,0:13:38.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在的我绝不能退缩
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.69,0:13:50.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还不死心啊 钢牙
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.82,0:13:52.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我让你解脱吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.60,0:14:00.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钢牙
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.30,0:14:03.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钢牙
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.31,0:14:16.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,解决了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.47,0:14:44.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,神乐
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.98,0:14:48.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,欺负那胆小狼有什么好玩的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.15,0:14:50.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.98,0:14:53.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在开始我当你的对手
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.65,0:14:56.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我应该没有看错
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.15,0:14:57.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然只是一瞬间
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.52,0:14:59.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚才犬夜叉的样子…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.00,0:15:05.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉这家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.76,0:15:06.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该不会已经被神乐看到
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.76,0:15:09.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人类的模样了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.28,0:15:27.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉这家伙是白痴吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.69,0:15:30.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,居然以那副模样冲出来
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.66,0:15:33.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是再迟一步的话 钢牙
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.52,0:15:36.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就会被神乐的风贯穿了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.93,0:15:38.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别笑死人了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.93,0:15:40.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道犬夜叉是为了救我
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.30,0:15:43.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱着半妖的秘密被发觉的觉悟
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.80,0:15:44.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,才跑来的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.40,0:15:48.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了 昨晚月亮没有出现
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.81,0:15:50.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.18,0:15:54.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在朔日会失去妖力吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.05,0:15:56.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那又怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.68,0:15:58.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要我变回来不就得了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.05,0:16:05.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,确实怎样都无所谓
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.82,0:16:08.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为你现在就要死在这了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.69,0:16:09.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,龙蛇之舞
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.93,0:16:13.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,风之伤
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.70,0:16:22.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么！居然能劈开我的龙卷风
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.57,0:16:23.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.58,0:16:27.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没办法躲开…我完了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.50,0:16:52.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落的妖怪群
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.87,0:16:58.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,挡了下来了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.48,0:17:04.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,神乐这家伙又溜走了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.45,0:17:07.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 瘦皮狼
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.19,0:17:09.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这下你该学到
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.22,0:17:12.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不该插手我和奈落的战斗了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.19,0:17:19.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找到了 我的四魂碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.93,0:17:22.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,臭家伙 给我
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.57,0:17:24.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁要给你啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.04,0:17:33.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不要忘了 大烂狗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.18,0:17:36.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落是我的同伴的仇人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.85,0:17:40.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我绝对要比你先
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.62,0:17:42.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,摘下奈落的脑袋
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.52,0:17:43.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你给我记住了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.26,0:17:46.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等 钢牙
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.96,0:17:48.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,昨晚你看到的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.13,0:17:50.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,关于犬夜叉的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.20,0:17:51.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对任何人都…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.80,0:17:53.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你放心吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.47,0:17:56.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我对大烂狗变成什么样子
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.47,0:17:57.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一点兴趣都没有
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.74,0:18:07.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,意思是他不会说吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.71,0:18:10.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钢牙应该不用担心吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.05,0:18:13.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,问题是神乐
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.43,0:18:33.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落没有发觉我的背叛
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.61,0:18:39.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以才会利用妖怪救了我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.12,0:18:50.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,神无 她想去什么地方
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.64,0:19:12.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,地牢的下面还有房间
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.50,0:19:33.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,神乐
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.93,0:19:36.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,外面好玩吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.98,0:19:53.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个身体…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.65,0:19:56.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是构成奈落身体的妖怪们
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.82,0:19:57.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来如此
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.26,0:20:01.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落也和犬夜叉同样是半妖
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.33,0:20:02.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,神乐
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.49,0:20:05.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在我沉眠的期间
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.90,0:20:08.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你跑出城了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.85,0:20:25.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,神乐 你是我的分身
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.98,0:20:28.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想再回到我的身体里吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.69,0:20:31.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等一下…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.76,0:20:35.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不会再擅作主张了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.86,0:20:40.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你记着别再有第二次了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.13,0:20:44.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一个人还是无法逃离奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.14,0:20:47.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.77,0:20:50.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,暂时就让你活着吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.91,0:20:52.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是我重要的王牌
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.22,0:21:06.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,往后可麻烦了哪
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.66,0:21:08.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,既然秘密被神乐知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.89,0:21:11.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,果然得靠我和珊瑚撑下去
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.50,0:21:14.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用不着做无谓的操心
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.80,0:21:17.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最后还不是要靠我的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.94,0:21:19.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.50,0:21:20.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘴硬而已啦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.91,0:21:23.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为犬夜叉在遇到大家之前
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.44,0:21:26.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,绝对不敢让别人看到人类的模样呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.18,0:21:30.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他很依赖大家的喔
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.25,0:21:32.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁依赖你们啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.92,0:21:34.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 不用害臊喔
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.95,0:21:36.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁在害臊啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.25,0:21:38.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 害臊了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.12,0:21:40.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,害臊了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.86,0:21:45.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们不要太过分了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.03,0:21:48.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我随时都让你依靠喔 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.20,0:21:50.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.47,0:21:54.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然总是吵吵闹闹的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.64,0:21:56.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是都相信着大家
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.37,0:22:01.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不再害怕朔日到来的犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.15,0:22:04.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许就是他变强的秘密
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.22,0:22:06.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊~真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.35,0:22:08.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吵死了 吵死了 吵死啦~
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.12,0:22:20.46,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,究竟要流多少泪{\fad(500,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.93,0:22:27.46,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Every Heart  才能坦白面对自己
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.77,0:22:33.97,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,倘若对谁传达情感
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.51,0:22:40.78,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Every Heart  是否就能得到满足{\fad(50,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.92,0:22:47.38,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,害怕着漫长漫长的夜晚
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.52,0:22:54.62,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,朝着遥远的星星祈祷着{\fad(0,250)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.80,0:23:01.26,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在不停流转的时空之中
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.54,0:23:08.03,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都在寻找真正的爱
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.24,0:23:14.70,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望自己能够变得更坚强
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.05,0:23:21.51,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天也要抬头看着高高的天空{\fad(0,100)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.82,0:23:28.28,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在不停流转的时空之中{\fad(150,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.50,0:23:35.06,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都在寻找生命的意义{\fad(0,350)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.45,0:23:48.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是七宝
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.92,0:23:50.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是正义的小狐狸妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.33,0:23:53.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而这样的我居然收到挑战书
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.99,0:23:55.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对方竟然是…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.26,0:23:59.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个飞天满天的 雷兽一族的残存者
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.03,0:24:02.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,居然敢向我挑战
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.64,0:24:05.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真…真是大胆啊
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.14,0:24:07.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,次回 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.84,0:24:10.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给七宝充满愤怒的挑战书
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.25,0:24:12.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我得好好的振作了
